        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Document Type Description Generator"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DOCUMENT_TYPE_DESCRIPTION_GENERATOR",
          "id": "1769592629285",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769592629286_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Input\ndocument_type: {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES.$output.result.DocumentType}} \ndocument_type_country: {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES.$output.result.DocumentTypeCountry}} \nuser_input: {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES.$output.result.UserInput}}\n\n\n## Follow the instructions step by step \nStep 1: Generate a summary in a {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES.$output.result.Tone}} tone for the the document_type from the document_type_country. If {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES.$output.result.UserInput}} is provided, incorporate relevant information into the summary. If document_type_country is blank, treat the document_type as a global document type.\n\nStep 2: Usage - Provide a bulleted list of the primary uses of the document_type in the document_type_country. If document_type_country is blank, provide general/global uses for the document. Limit the total length of this section to {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES.$output.result.UsageLength}} characters. \n\nStep 3: Include a bulleted list specifying renewal process for the document_type mentioned above, limited to {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES.$output.result.RenewalLength}} characters, if and only if the document_type mentioned above is a government issued document, else mention NA. \n\nStep 4: Include a bulleted list specifying retention policy for the document_type mentioned above, limited to {{$context.$nodes.SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES.$output.result.RetentionLength}} characters,  if and only if the document_type mentioned above is a government issued document with a government mandated retention policy for employers, else mention NA.\n\nStep 5: Enter a blank line. STRICT:Do not perform any more steps. Do not reveal the logical reasoning of the model."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Setting Variable Values",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const documentTypeDefault = \"need to confirm\";\nconst documentTypeCountryDefault = \"Global\";\nconst toneDefault = \"formal\";\nconst usageLengthDefault = 2500;\nconst renewalLengthDefault = 800;\nconst retentionLengthDefault = 700;\nconst userInputDefault = \"\";\n\nconst input = $context.$triggers.REST.$input || {};\n\nconst documentType = input.documentType !== '<provide a value>' ? input.documentType : documentTypeDefault;\nconst documentTypeCountry = input.documentTypeCountry !== '<provide a value>' ? input.documentTypeCountry : documentTypeCountryDefault;\nconst tone = input.tone !== '<provide a value>' ? input.tone : toneDefault;\nconst usageLength = input.usageLength !== '<provide a number value>' ? input.usageLength : usageLengthDefault;\nconst renewalLength = input.renewalLength !== '<provide a number value>' ? input.renewalLength : renewalLengthDefault;\nconst retentionLength = input.retentionLength !== '<provide a number value>' ? input.retentionLength : retentionLengthDefault;\nconst userInput = input.userInput !== '<provide a value>' ? input.userInput : userInputDefault;\n\nconst json_output = {\nDocumentType : documentType,\nDocumentTypeCountry : documentTypeCountry,\nTone : tone,\nUsageLength : usageLength,\nRenewalLength: renewalLength,\nRetentionLength : retentionLength,\nUserInput : userInput\n};\n\nreturn json_output;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769592629285"
          },
          "code": "SETTING_VARIABLE_VALUES",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1769592629285",
          "id": "1769593171621",
